WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:07.716
It's over.

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:10.343
I think it's just getting started.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.434
We killed someone.

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:19.436
It was self-defense.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.440
Ever since Jake ran off 
to Mexico,

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:26.276
Murder Club have been looking 
extremely guilty.

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:30.196
So, we all got the same 
message?

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.740
Simon says, "Do what I say,

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.033
or everyone will know 
what you did."

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:37.287
We have to figure out who 
Simon Says is.

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:40.081
And until then, we need to do 
whatever they say.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.001
They're blackmailing us.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:43.918
Oh my God.

00:00:43.918 --> 00:00:45.045
Ahhh!

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.882
What the hell are you 
two doing?

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:51.134
Whoever Simon Says is,

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:52.886
they're getting more twisted.

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:54.804
You're actually going 
through with this.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.222
What does this psycho want?

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:03.897
Whoa.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:06.983
Go Jake!

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:08.568
We have to put an end to this.

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:09.736
Ahh!

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.279
You are making a big mistake.

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:16.159
There have been so many lies.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:17.702
Did you tell anybody?

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:19.871
And rumors,

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.708
about Jake since he 
disappeared.

00:01:25.543 --> 00:01:27.045
Simon Says come out!

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:27.837
Ahhh!

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:30.381
I think it's time

00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:32.842
for the truth.

00:01:38.014 --> 00:01:38.306
Ahhh!

